+    The two classes live on different pages. Sending an operator to the PAT page
+    for a `gho_` grant means they revoke nothing and the grant stays live -- and
+    that grant is currently what authenticates this repo, so the same sentence
+    invites severing the only working auth before a replacement is proven.
+    """
